  "unaffected": "The six genuine sliders all have exactly 6 blocks and keep their arrows: index.json reviews, and the `content` section on page.brightening-glow, page.collagen-skin-plumping, page.fine-lines-wrinkles, page.firming-skin-density and page.skin-repair-renewal. Sections with a single block were never touched by either threshold.",
